230 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (To us, sustainability is a key value. We heavily prioritize retaining student interest in our community and school to allow robotics programs to thrive.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
231 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
232 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (Our team is taking charge in our community to be STEAM activists, advocates and ambassadors. We participate in community outreach every single year. We provide opportunities to students and others alike, which open them to a whole new community. This helps keep STEAM culture alive in our community and also preserves the legacy of our team. However, in doing this, we allow our newer members to step up. This helps them build confidence and leadership skills, allowing us to sustain our team. Our goal is to not only inspire others outside of the team, but to also help our own members grow into innovators and leaders who will guide the next generation of our team.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
