/E (This season, we relied on a tryout process to select our team members. Over 20 students came to attempt the tryouts, many more visited the lab to show interest and learn what we are about. The purpose of introducing the tryouts to our selection process was to assess whether students could succeed in tasks required for the team as well as if they were open to learning more. Our tryout process also helped students truly understand what our competition was about, allowing them to get experience before the real competition.)
/Pg 12 0 R
