<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (The last thing we knew we needed was a shoot system. We landed on a horizontal flywheel design that could move up and down to utilize more space. We included a transfer system to push the artifacts from the indexer directly to the launcher. Our chassis design itself was formed like a U to allow us full access to the inside of the robot.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
252 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (When designing the second iteration of our robot, we made multiple changes to improve our efficiency while in a match. We changed the design of the indexer to have  walls which flared out. We also changed the actuator on the intake from a servo to a motor to improve speed and efficiency. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (As for the shooter, we released compression from the top portion of the ball by raising the top of the assembly, creating an arch. We also made the shooter itself stationary and no longer able to lift up and down to make our cycle time quicker.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
254 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (When designing our third iteration we thought of the indexer and shooter. We needed a better hold on the artifacts while the indexer was rotating. To do this, we made built-in walls to the indexer that wrapped around the artifact. This allowed us to rotate the indexer faster compared to before. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
255 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (To solve a lot of problems with shooting, we needed to minimize variation in the shooting trajectory of the artifact. To fix this, we moved the transfer system to be above the indexer. We also made a chute inside the shooter to better fit to the artifacts.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
256 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (As we move into league championship, we aim to improve the accuracy more by moving the wheels further from each other in order to lower the amount of compression of the artifacts.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
