/P 83 0 R
/E (Our autonomous system is designed to be used within an adaptive environment. Working with our alliance partner, we determine which autonomous paths to use. Then, we use our queue creator to make the path sequence, and our Limelight camera to detect the motif from the obelisk. This allows our autonomous strategy to mesh well in any environment.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
