<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 84 0 R
/E (Our queuing system allows us to combine and select paths to create unique autonomous sequences for certain scenarios. This is especially useful for working alongside alliance partners. We can build path chains around the alliance's abilities and weaknesses. The queue creator is very accessible and easy to use in a competition setting. Instead of having to go through the code to change paths, we can dynamically create path chains from the Driver Hub by selecting path segments in a preferred order. The ability to change and edit our autonomous program as we change alliance partners allows our strategy during autonomous mode to be very adaptable.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [26]
>>
