/E (Lots of different systems on our robot utilize PIDF controllers. For example, our chassis utilizes PIDF controllers on all four of our drive motors to move during the autonomous period and help with defensive driving. In addition, our shooter motors use PIDF controllers to help maintain a set velocity when launching artifacts. Lastly, we apply a PIDF controller to our indexer for precise and swift positioning.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
