/E (Being involved in the FIRST community is one of the largest contributions we as an FTC team can provide. One of the many ways we helped our community this season was by always being there to help set up for events when needed. We helped set up for multiple different events, such as our third meet and the FIRST Lego League Mix and Mingle. We have also collaborated with many other teams amongst us, including those just starting out. Being a FIRST ambassador means empowering others through teamwork, and creating an impact that lasts beyond competition.)
